{
 "schema": "project-forever/route-segment",
 "pack": "horde-20-40-01-barrens-a",
 "title": "Crossroads start (Moonglade for druids)",
 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "horde-20-40:handoff-from-1-20",
   "tags": {},
   "text": [
    {
     "segments": [
      {
       "t": "Start at the Crossroads, level 20. The 1-20 Barrens guide ends by killing Stormsnouts south of Camp Taurajo until level 20 (skip that grind if you are already 20). Your hearth is already set at Innkeeper Boorand Plainswind. You already have the Crossroads, Ratchet, and Camp Taurajo flight paths. The quest log is empty. Chen's Empty Keg (819 and 821), the Samophlange chain (3921, 3922, 3923, and 3924), and Mura Runetotem (3301) are already finished; do not accept them again, and do not accept Miner's Fortune (896). Pick up Serena Bloodfeather from Darsok Swiftdagger. Later at Camp Taurajo, continue Jorn Skyseer's thunder-lizard chain (Enraged Thunder Lizards, then Cry of the Thunderhawk) only if you are not Skyborne — Ishamuhale is already done. Skyborne skips that chain. When Include dungeons is on, turn-ins for 959, 1487, 6981, and 3369 are inserted immediately after this step. Do not run Wailing Caverns, Ragefire Chasm, or the Ruins of Lordaeron again in this pack."
      },
      {
       "t": "XP buffs live on the Profile page: Well Fed, rested, Legacy Well Rested, and Cozy Sleeping Bag. Turn those on there instead of treating them as extra route steps."
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "actions": [
    {
