     "text": "Merchant's Favor crates are turned in at this Horde camp outside the Crossroads. The currency is said to buy about 320 recipes no trainer teaches. Both NPC locations are in the quest database; the recipe count is unverified here.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://github.com/Questie/QuestieDB/releases/tag/v1.1.3",
       "label": "QuestieDB v1.1.3 Forever release (pinned PR #5, commit 8b8df2d)"
      },
      {
       "url": "https://warcraftmaps.com/guides/classic-vs-forever-professions",
       "label": "WarcraftMaps: Classic vs Forever professions (cited by Sentinel)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": false
    },
    {
     "kind": "profession",
     "text": "Forever profession rules worth using on this route: healing potions moved to First Aid; each corpse can be skinned only once; every profession unlocks a Camp at skill 20; crafting to sell to vendors no longer pays.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://warcraftmaps.com/guides/classic-vs-forever-professions",
       "label": "WarcraftMaps: Classic vs Forever professions (cited by Sentinel)"
      }
     ],
     "verified": false
    },
    {
     "kind": "profession",
     "text": "Optional: outdoor rested XP comes from a Leatherworking Camp Tent (skill 20), which adds 5% of a level if you are below that, not from the campfire itself.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "url": "https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/24301516/gather-around-the-campfire-in-world-of-warcraft-forever",
       "label": "Blizzard camping: Basic Campfire is Cooking 1; Camp Tent is the rested object"
      },
      {
       "url": "https://www.wowhead.com/forever/guide/camping-overview-unlock-rewards",
       "label": "Wowhead Camp Tent row: skill 20, 5% of a level"
      }
     ],
     "verified": false
    }
   ],
